# chat-vault-typed's request for a token the person types in (sfpages decision.mbt vault_ask_card, settings
# vault_ask.mbt vault_foot): its field over 存入 (which waits for something in it), typed in as dots, 存入, then
# 已存入Token「OpenCode Go」 in its place.
timeout 20000
until 粘贴 Token
wait 800
tap 粘贴 Token
wait 300
type sk-go-4f1e9a7c
wait 900
tap =存入
until 已存入
wait 1200
